{"id":"5f2ffbfa1e13e5e2","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-sigma1-completeness.md","title":"Sigma 1 Completeness","display":"thm-sigma1-completeness — Sigma_1 Completeness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-sigma1-completeness","aliases":["92-thm-sigma1-completeness"],"display":"thm-sigma1-completeness — Sigma_1 Completeness","depends_on":["[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-standard-model]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 V 章 pp. 63–74（PDF 80–91）","source_status":"原书 Σ₀/Σ₁ 完备性的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-sigma1-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-sigma1-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sigma1-completeness — Sigma_1 Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 63–74（PDF 80–91）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书 Σ₀/Σ₁ 完备性的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (sufficient arithmetic strength)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> (first existential arithmetical level)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span> (standard arithmetic structure)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma1\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\varphi\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma1\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\varphi\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>完备性：真<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>句子可证</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi = \\exists x_1 \\ldots \\exists x_k\\;\\psi\">\\(\\varphi = \\exists x_1 \\ldots \\exists x_k\\;\\psi\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span></li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\\models\\varphi\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\models\\varphi\\)</span>，则存在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_1,\\ldots,n_k\">\\(n_1,\\ldots,n_k\\)</span>使把相应numeral无捕获代入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>所得闭句在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>中为真</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>句子真则可证（原始递归可判定）</li>\n<li>因此<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>证明把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n_1,\\ldots,\\bar n_k\">\\(\\bar n_1,\\ldots,\\bar n_k\\)</span>依次无捕获代入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>所得的闭实例</li>\n<li>由存在引入规则，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G \\vdash \\varphi\">\\(G \\vdash \\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>可证性公式可用存在计算见证选为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>，不必先断言当前裸证明码关系具有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 表示；本定理说明真<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>实例为何能在含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>的理论中被验证，而不是它的句法定义来源</li>\n</ul>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>真存在句有标准数码见证；有界真实例的可证性靠基本数码运算、有限界展开和等式演算，而非仅靠外部 PR 可判定性。原书以 Σ₀ 完备性证明在系统内的枚举条件。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 63–74（PDF 80–91）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-sigma1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8fd1dce21b2c65db","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-standard-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q","status":"resolved","id":"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"算术强度核对：$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ 表示每条 $Q$ 公理在 $G$ 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见[[92-lem-local-pa-proves-q]]；若继续要求 $Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)$，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 $G$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma1\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\varphi\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\varphi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi = \\exists x_1 \\ldots \\exists x_k\\;\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N}\\models\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"n_1,\\ldots,n_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n_1,\\ldots,\\bar n_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"G \\vdash \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":2329,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-bounded-quantifier]]与[[92-thm-sigma1-completeness]]属于本地 $Q$ 的有界/见证推理；原书 (Q)、(R) 的呈现与本库七公理 $Q$ 不逐字相同。"},{"id":"56f4ef08abc6d228","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-305","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-sigma1-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["8fd1dce21b2c65db","e0eabee5d77258a7","ccb738ae4bbf923c","468d35690d25ee42","90f32e29c9d553ed","975b3aa9a1e08797","0a1ba58f66cc8d4e"]}